  "title": "Supplementary Table S4. Cohort construction, outcome derivation and covariate framework",
  "panel": "",
  "panel_title": "",
  "notes_before": [],
  "notes_after": [
    "Note. This table summarises the archived cohort construction, documented outcome definition and covariate framework. The original calibration code linked to the stored primary BAA was unavailable, and the intermediate two-wave selection step could not be reproduced exactly from the merged raw file. CRP <10 mg/L was used to reduce acute inflammatory influence on biomarker-based age estimation. The main text describes the 2011-wave complement of this frame (17,708 interviewed participants); the sequential counts above follow the merged multi-wave file.",
    "Abbreviations: BAA, biological age acceleration; CHARLS, China Health and Retirement Longitudinal Study; CRP, C-reactive protein; VIF, variance inflation factor."
  ],
